From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 16:15:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm: mediatek: program MT6878 DSC version

The MT6878 DSC encoder has a separate version field in register 0x200.
NothingOS programs bits 6:5 to 1 for the Tetris panel's DSC 1.1 stream,
independently of the shadow-control register at 0x228.

The mainline-based MT6878 port configures the complete PPS but leaves this
field at its inherited value.  Program DSC 1.1 together with the rest of the
MT6878 encoder state.  Other MediaTek DSC implementations are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_ddp_comp.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_ddp_comp.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_ddp_comp.c
index e14edc200000..e14edc200001 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_ddp_comp.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_ddp_comp.c
@@ -62,6 +62,9 @@
 #define DISP_REG_DSC_PPS0			0x0080
 #define DISP_REG_DSC_SHADOW_MT6878		0x0228
 #define DSC_FORCE_COMMIT			BIT(0)
+#define DISP_REG_DSC_VERSION_MT6878		0x0200
+#define DSC_VERSION_MASK			GENMASK(6, 5)
+#define DSC_VERSION_1_1			BIT(5)
 #define DSC_BYPASS_SHADOW			BIT(1)
 
 #define DISP_REG_OD_EN				0x0000
@@ -288,6 +291,10 @@ static void mtk_dsc_encoder_config(struct device *dev,
 	mtk_ddp_write_mask(cmdq_pkt, DSC_CKSM_CAL_EN, &priv->cmdq_reg,
 			   priv->regs, DISP_REG_DSC_DBG_CON, DSC_CKSM_CAL_EN);
 
+	mtk_ddp_write_mask(cmdq_pkt, DSC_VERSION_1_1, &priv->cmdq_reg,
+			   priv->regs, DISP_REG_DSC_VERSION_MT6878,
+			   DSC_VERSION_MASK);
+
 	reg_val = (dsc->line_buf_depth & 0xf) |
 		  (dsc->bits_per_component << 4) |
 		  (dsc->bits_per_pixel << 8) |
